{
  "name": "PODOIA - Sub: Google Calendar",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PODOIA - Sub: Google Calendar\n\nLlamado por el Agente de IA como herramienta.\n\n**Acciones:**\n- verificar_disponibilidad → FreeBusy + slots\n- agendar_cita → Evento Google Calendar + Supabase\n- cancelar_cita → Eliminar evento + actualizar DB\n\n**Config (editable en Parsear Params):**\n- Horario laboral: 08:00–18:00\n- Duración slot: 45 min\n- Pausa entre citas: 15 min",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -100
      ],
      "id": "671559b6-ef66-4ba0-97ae-95e8eba5014e",
      "name": "Nota"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "id": "edaa74dd-2b77-4bb7-b3e4-a5c44e7803d0",
      "name": "Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst input = $json.query ? (typeof $json.query === 'string' ? JSON.parse($json.query) : $json.query) : $json;\nlet action = (input.action||input.accion||'verificar_disponibilidad').toLowerCase();\nif (action.includes('agend')||action.includes('crear')||action.includes('reserv')) action='agendar_cita';\nelse if (action.includes('cancel')||action.includes('elimin')) action='cancelar_cita';\nelse action='verificar_disponibilidad';\n\nlet date = input.date||input.fecha||'';\nif (!date) { const d=new Date(); d.setDate(d.getDate()+1); date=d.toISOString().split('T')[0]; }\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  action, date,\n  time: input.time||input.hora||'',\n  treatment: input.treatment||input.tratamiento||'Consulta podológica',\n  patientName: input.patient_name||input.nombre||'',\n  patientPhone: input.patient_phone||input.telefono||'',\n  patientEmail: input.email||'',\n  patientId: input.patient_id||'',\n  clientId: input.client_id||'',\n  eventId: input.event_id||input.id_evento||'',\n  calendarId: input.calendar_id||'primary',\n  slotMinutes: 45,\n  breakMinutes: 15,\n  dayStart: '08:00',\n  dayEnd: '18:00'\n}}];\n"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        200
      ],
      "id": "46763503-583d-4b53-933f-0febfd703986",
      "name": "Parsear Params"
    },
